Kingdom Hearts Switch Patcher desktop application, version 1.1
Copyright 2026. Licensed under Apache License 2.0.

This desktop application combines the existing KH1 v2 and KH2 v9 Python
patch workflows in separate worker processes. Their source and NOTICE files
are included under engines/kh1 and engines/kh2. Upstream archive references,
credits and licensing are retained in those directories.

The desktop interface, job controller, worker adapter and abstract crown icon
are original application code/assets. The GUI uses Python's standard Tkinter
library; Python and Tcl/Tk are installed separately by the user.

On Windows, the application downloads missing or unusable FFmpeg tools from
Gyan.dev into its own bin directory. The pinned package is FFmpeg 9.0.2
essentials, a separate GPLv3-or-later distribution, not part of this project's
Apache-2.0 code. Its SHA-256 is checked before installation. The upstream
LICENSE and README are saved alongside the downloaded programs. No FFmpeg
binary is included in this source package.
